      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Centre and spokes" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Magic ring. Round 1: ch 3, 15 tr (16 tr). Round 2: *ch 10, sl st into 2nd tr from base to form a spoke stem; repeat 7 times (8 spokes)." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Connecting rings" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Ring 1 (inner): slip stitch along the first spoke to the 4th ch, chain 6, slip stitch to the same position on the next spoke. Repeat around all 8 spokes. Ring 2 (mid): work the same connecting chain at the 8th chain position. Ring 3 (outer): work at the 12th chain position, using chain 8 arcs." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Outer border" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Work a final round of chain arcs along the spoke tips and between them. Picot each arc. Fasten off and weave in the end. Block flat." }]
      }
    ]
  }
